Account for brcmfmac firmware supplied by this image.

Hello Guix receives this Mac's device firmware from Asahi before Linux boots.
Do not report its brcmfmac device as unusable solely because that firmware is
not included by GNU Guix. This is downstream image policy, not a proposal to
change Guix's free-software policy. Other unsupported-device warnings remain.

--- a/gnu/installer/hardware.scm
+++ b/gnu/installer/hardware.scm
@@ -34,7 +34,6 @@
   ;; non-free firmware available from
   ;; <https://packages.debian.org/search?keywords=firmware&searchon=names&suite=stable&section=all>.
   '(;; WiFi.
-    "brcmfmac"
     "ipw2100"
     "ipw2200"
     "iwlwifi"
